utable exposure design before full retrieval or finalization. The first amendment's changed_dimensions must contain the complete design: geographic_representation, assignment_method, source_strategy, exposure_metric, daily_aggregation, analysis_aggregation, coverage_policy, and intended_use. Cite the returned contract_path in the final result.\",\n      \"input_schema\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"changed_dimensions\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"On the first amendment, include the executable exposure fields. Later amendments contain only evidence-backed dimensions that changed.\"\n          },\n          \"evidence\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"artifact\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"finding\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"artifact\",\n                \"finding\"\n              ],\n              \"additionalProperties\": false\n            }\n          },\n          \"scientific_justification\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"fidelity_impact\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"none\",\n              \"source_substitution\",\n              \"coverage_subset\",\n              \"covariate_omission\",\n              \"construct_change\",\n              \"supported_sensitivity\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"agreement_independent\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"changed_dimensions\",\n          \"evidence\",\n          \"scientific_justification\",\n          \"fidelity_impact\",\n          \"agreement_independent\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"requires_r