              }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"dimension\",\n                \"change_type\"\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          \"evidence_artifacts\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"reported_variants\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"recovery_checklist\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"For bounded or construct-changing fits, include author_repository_applicable, author_repository_attempted, and author_repository_evidence. The evidence value must name a saved artifact. Stopped runs also require the complete recovery checklist. The stop checklist must state whether an article-named regulator applies, preserve evidence, inspect the portal interface, and attempt at least three distinct public recovery routes. It must also preserve at least two discovery searches, follow plausible results, and inspect a public client or source implementation when one exists. If an official bulk endpoint failed, it must also preserve an exact-file mirror search. Search results and applicable public clients must be inspected, not merely listed. It must list concrete stop_counterexamples_tested and saved stop_counterexample_evidence.\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"executable_attempts\": {\n                \"type\": \"array\",\n                \"items\": {\n                  \"type\": \"object\",\n                  \"properties\": {\n                    \"request_url\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"command\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\"\n                    },\n                    \"source_role\": {\n                      \"type\": \"string\",\n                      \"enum\": [\n  